{"translation-revision-date":"YEAR-MO-DA HO:MI+ZONE","generator":"WP-CLI\/2.12.0","source":"build\/onboarding.js","domain":"messages","locale_data":{"messages":{"":{"domain":"messages","lang":"en","plural-forms":"nplurals=2; plural=(n != 1);"},"Adding a model with Gutenberg:":[""],"Edit any post or page, then click <strong>+<\/strong> or type <strong>\/3D Model Viewer<\/strong> to insert the block":[""],"Upload your model file and set size, camera controls, and auto-rotate in the block sidebar":[""],"Preview the model, then publish":[""],"Adding a model with Elementor:":[""],"Edit a page with Elementor and search the widget panel for <strong>Model Viewer<\/strong>":[""],"Drag the widget onto your layout and upload your model file":[""],"Adjust size, camera controls, and auto-rotate, then publish":[""],"Adding a model with a shortcode:":[""],"Go to <strong>3D Viewer &rsaquo; Add New<\/strong>, upload your file, and publish the model":[""],"Copy its <code>[3d_viewer id=\"\u2026\"]<\/code> shortcode from the edit screen or the models list":[""],"Paste the shortcode into any post, page, or widget":[""],"Three ways to add a model \u2014 pick one above for step-by-step instructions:":[""],"<strong>Gutenberg<\/strong> \u2014 insert the 3D Model Viewer block in any post or page":[""],"<strong>Elementor<\/strong> \u2014 drag the Model Viewer widget into a section":[""],"<strong>Shortcode<\/strong> \u2014 publish a model under 3D Viewer, then paste its shortcode anywhere":[""],"Welcome to 3D Viewer":[""],"3D Viewer \u2014 short tutorial":[""],"Let\u2019s get your first 3D model on the page. It takes about a minute, and everything you set here can be changed later.":[""],"Display GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, FBX, DAE, and more \u2014 no conversion needed":[""],"Add models with a Gutenberg block, the Elementor widget, or a shortcode":[""],"Let visitors rotate, zoom, and pan the model right in the browser":[""],"Show a 3D model in place of a WooCommerce product image":[""],"Let\u2019s Get Started":[""],"What\u2019s included with 3D Viewer":[""],"Everything marked Included works right now on the free version. Pro unlocks the rest whenever you need it.":[""],"Skip":[""],"Upgrade to Pro":[""],"Wide Format Support":[""],"Included":[""],"GLB, GLTF, OBJ, STL, FBX, DAE, 3DS, and more \u2014 upload the file you already have.":[""],"Gutenberg, Elementor & Shortcodes":[""],"Place a model with a block, the Elementor widget, or a shortcode anywhere.":[""],"WooCommerce Product Viewers":[""],"Show a rotatable 3D model above, below, or instead of the product gallery.":[""],"Responsive & Mobile Ready":[""],"Adapts to any screen, with touch controls and a poster image while loading.":[""],"Augmented Reality":[""],"Pro":[""],"View models in the room with WebXR, Scene Viewer, and iOS Quick Look, plus QR access from mobile.":[""],"Hotspots & Initial View":[""],"Annotate parts of the model and choose the exact camera angle it opens on.":[""],"And much more":[""],"Lighting, shadow and exposure control, axis locking, auto-rotate and fullscreen options.":[""],"Last step \u2014 how will you add models?":[""],"Pick how you usually build pages and the steps below will match. You can still use any of the other methods later.":[""],"Preferred method":[""],"Gutenberg":[""],"Insert the 3D Model Viewer block in the editor":[""],"Elementor":[""],"Drag the Model Viewer widget into a section":[""],"Shortcode":[""],"Paste [3d_viewer id=\"\u2026\"] into any post or widget":[""],"Visit <a href=\"%s\">3D Viewer &rsaquo; Help & Demos<\/a> any time for live demos and documentation":[""],"Add Your First 3D Model":[""]}}}